WEBVTT

00:00:03.416 --> 00:00:09.266
A space for every destination. From “All cities”, open Madrid, Barcelona or any day trip. Choose where to start and return to this view whenever needed.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:17.600
Your day, step by step. Review the order of activities, estimated times and travel between stops. Change days while keeping the city context.

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:23.033
Open the details. Expand an activity to read directions, context and duration. Open or close only what you want to read.

00:00:23.041 --> 00:00:29.941
Switch to a day-trip day. The Segovia day appears within your Madrid stay. You can also open Segovia’s own workspace. The day trip remains linked to its base city.

00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:43.408
Choose your route endpoints. Select origin and destination. Prepare the route, then open Google Maps or Waze to navigate. Google Maps uses both points; Waze navigates to the destination from your location.

00:00:43.416 --> 00:00:50.316
You can also prepare your trip. “For your trip” brings together tickets, experiences and transport options related to your route. Exploring these options is optional.

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:57.233
Tickets and reservations. Open options related to each activity and compare available alternatives. Confirm date, price and conditions on the provider’s website.

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:04.150
Tours and experiences. Browse guided activities and experiences linked to the cities and visits in your itinerary. Choose only what interests you; you do not need to book here to use your itinerary.

00:01:04.166 --> 00:01:11.066
Transport and connections. Browse options for traveling between cities or taking your day trips. Check schedules and availability before booking.

00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:17.983
Your day trip has an itinerary. Open Segovia’s workspace to see its own activities and routes. Toledo, Montserrat and Girona also have their own workspace.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:24.900
Continue with Barcelona. Browse Barcelona’s days and review each activity in the same way. Each destination keeps its dates and context.

00:01:24.916 --> 00:01:36.116
Return through My Trips. Reopen your saved trip or download the PDF and Excel again from its card. “My Trips” keeps your 30 most recently generated itineraries.
